Third-party code in this repository keeps its own notice in each file:

- core/mps*.c, core/mps*.h (except core/mps_xnu*, core/mps_mpi.h): FreeBSD
  sys/dev/mps, BSD-2-Clause (LSI Corporation, Avago Technologies and FreeBSD
  contributors). Pristine copies are on the branch vendor/freebsd-mps; see
  core/VENDOR.txt.
- core/mpi/*: LSI/Avago MPI2 headers from FreeBSD sys/dev/mps/mpi,
  BSD-2-Clause, unmodified.
- core/compat/queue.h: trimmed FreeBSD sys/sys/queue.h, BSD-3-Clause (The
  Regents of the University of California).
- core/mps_xnu.c: its SCSI decoder tables follow FreeBSD
  sys/cam/scsi/scsi_all.c, BSD-2-Clause (Justin T. Gibbs, Kenneth D. Merry).
